# Changelog

## v3.0.4 (2026-08-13)

Initial PyPI release.

- Full Snakemake workflow for barcode recovery
- Barcode validation: structural (HMM-based) and taxonomic (local BLASTn)
- `beegees run` CLI with `--profile local` and `--profile slurm` support
- Bundled config and Snakemake profiles installable via `pip install beegees`
- MultiQC report integration across all samples
